Package: annotatoR
Title: Flexible Annotation System for Human Labeling Tasks
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Will", "Schulz", email = "wschulz@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny-based annotation tool backed by SQLite. Provides both an
    interactive web UI for annotators and an R API for programmatically creating
    and managing labeling tasks from research projects.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
